  "title": "Indian Stir-Fried Shrimp in Cream Sauce (Bhagari Jhinga)",
  "description": "This Indian-style stir-fried shrimp dish in a creamy, mildly spiced sauce is easy to prepare and makes a satisfying meal when served over basmati rice.",
